      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "For the Opposite Party/s : Mr. Rajendra Nath Jha, APP  ======================================================\n CORAM: HONOURABLE MR. JUSTICE RAJIV ROY  ORAL ORDER 2 10-11-2023 Heard learned counsel for the petitioner and learned APP for the State.\nThe petitioner is in judicial custody in connection with K. Nagar P.S. Case No. 87 of 2021 corresponding to S.Tr. No. 170 of 2021/C.I.S. No. 170 of 2021 registered under Sections 498A, 306 and 34 of the Indian Penal Code lodged on 04.03.2021 by the informant, Mukesh Sharma.\nCall for a report regarding the stage of the trial from the Court of learned Additional Sessions Judge-X, Purnea in connection with K. Nagar P.S. Case No. 87 of 2021 corresponding to S.Tr. No.\n170 of 2021/C.I.S. No. 170 of 2021 Put up this case after receipt of the same.\n(Rajiv Roy, J) Neha/-\nU T Akhilesh Sharma vs The State Of Bihar on 10 November, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/93784612/\n1",
